# Governança

- **Humano:** [INICIO.md](../../INICIO.md) → [docs/00-project-lifecycle.md](../../docs/00-project-lifecycle.md) → [docs/00-getting-started.md](../../docs/00-getting-started.md)
- **Detalhe:** [docs/00-project-governance.md](../../docs/00-project-governance.md)

## Regras

- **Spawn (Fase −1):** `make create-project` → pasta irmã — [spawn-project.md](../../docs/operations/spawn-project.md)
- **Descoberta leve:** visão/escopo → **bootstrap** + mocks → **planejamento MVP** (fases, cards, REQs)
- **Cards:** dev a partir de CARD-XXX; skill `card-tracking`
- SDD: spec **approved** antes de código (exceto hotfix → `docs/operations/hotfix.md`)
- TDD: red → green → refactor; teste antes de implementar
- Contrato do projeto > sugestão da IA
- Entrega: atualizar `delivery-log.md` + `traceability-matrix.md`
- Skills: **project-discovery** | **project-bootstrap** | **project-mvp-planning** | **card-tracking** | **feature-delivery**
- Fase entregue: retro ou skip em `docs/meta/retrospectives/` (skill **phase-retrospective**; soft gate)
- Métricas: `docs/meta/process-timeline.yaml` + painel HTML (skill **process-metrics**; transparente)
